WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:17.519
An armored truck drove along West Street.

2
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.963
Two guards sat in the front.

3
00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:23.177
"I'm glad there's no traffic," said the driver.

4
00:00:23.178 --> 00:00:25.961
"Yep," said the other guard.

5
00:00:25.962 --> 00:00:30.562
Suddenly—shwoosh! Something grabbed the truck.

6
00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:36.748
"Whoa!" cried the driver.

7
00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:40.017
The truck crashed into a mailbox.

8
00:00:40.018 --> 00:00:47.535
A voice called out, "Yee-ha!"

9
00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:51.371
Brumm! Brumm!

10
00:00:51.372 --> 00:00:55.812
"Those monster trucks are awesome!" cried Mara.

11
00:00:55.813 --> 00:00:58.997
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Arena.

12
00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:01.527
They were watching monster trucks.

13
00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.936
The trucks were really loud.

14
00:01:03.937 --> 00:01:06.475
They all looked like different things.

15
00:01:06.476 --> 00:01:08.829
One truck looked like a gorilla.

16
00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.725
Another one had a shark's fin on top.

17
00:01:11.726 --> 00:01:14.780
Brumm! Brumm!

18
00:01:14.781 --> 00:01:17.803
A red and blue monster truck drove into the arena.

19
00:01:17.804 --> 00:01:22.115
The crowd cheered.

20
00:01:22.116 --> 00:01:25.996
"It's the Rocket Girl monster truck!" Jack cried.

21
00:01:25.997 --> 00:01:28.333
Roxy smiled.

22
00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:31.825
The truck had a cape and two bunches of hair.

23
00:01:31.826 --> 00:01:35.176
Two arms stuck out over its front wheels.

24
00:01:35.177 --> 00:01:37.534
"Cool!" said Terrell.

25
00:01:37.535 --> 00:01:40.610
"It looks like Rocket Girl flying!"

26
00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:43.872
Brumm! Brumm!

27
00:01:43.873 --> 00:01:47.874
The Rocket Girl monster truck tore through the mud.

28
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:50.397
Everyone cheered.

29
00:01:50.398 --> 00:01:55.229
"I can't wait to see the truck crush those cars!" said Jack.

30
00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.782
He pointed to a row of junky cars in the arena.

31
00:01:58.783 --> 00:02:04.092
The truck went up a dirt ramp and flew through the air.

32
00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:07.228
Everyone cheered again.

33
00:02:07.229 --> 00:02:12.553
Crunch! The Rocket Girl monster truck landed on the junky cars.

34
00:02:12.554 --> 00:02:16.178
Metal twisted. Glass shattered.

35
00:02:16.179 --> 00:02:18.565
The crowd cheered loudly.

36
00:02:18.566 --> 00:02:22.355
"Go, Rocket Girl monster truck!"

37
00:02:22.356 --> 00:02:24.327
"Woo-hoo!"

38
00:02:24.328 --> 00:02:28.735
"The Rocket Girl monster truck is the best!"

39
00:02:28.736 --> 00:02:33.207
Brumm, brumm, brumm, brumm!

40
00:02:33.208 --> 00:02:36.670
The Rocket Girl monster truck spun around in circles.

41
00:02:36.671 --> 00:02:39.340
Mud went everywhere!

42
00:02:39.341 --> 00:02:42.261
Roxy and her friends cheered.

43
00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:46.270
"I wonder if Rocket Girl is driving that truck," said Jack.

44
00:02:46.271 --> 00:02:48.744
"I doubt it," said Terrell.

45
00:02:48.745 --> 00:02:51.787
Roxy was surprised. "Really?"

46
00:02:51.788 --> 00:02:53.641
Terrell shrugged.

47
00:02:53.642 --> 00:02:58.286
"Yeah. I'm sure Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

48
00:02:58.287 --> 00:03:02.934
Roxy smiled. "You're probably right, Terrell."

49
00:03:02.935 --> 00:03:05.680
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:03:05.681 --> 00:03:07.824
She looked at her friends.

51
00:03:07.825 --> 00:03:14.192
"I'm going to, um, get some snacks," she said.

52
00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:17.455
She stood up and started to walk away.

53
00:03:17.456 --> 00:03:19.709
"Oh!" cried Mara.

54
00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.354
"Can you get some popcorn for me?"

55
00:03:22.355 --> 00:03:25.919
"And another soda for me!" said Jack.

56
00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:29.011
"I'll have a pretzel!" said Terrell.

57
00:03:29.012 --> 00:03:34.931
Roxy rolled her eyes. "Oh, uh, sure."

58
00:03:34.932 --> 00:03:43.011
Roxy ran up the stairs and found a quiet area.

59
00:03:43.012 --> 00:03:45.815
She pressed a button on her watch.

60
00:03:45.816 --> 00:03:50.344
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy. "What's going on?"

61
00:03:50.345 --> 00:03:53.750
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

62
00:03:53.751 --> 00:03:57.336
"Someone robbed an armored truck on West Street!"

63
00:03:57.337 --> 00:03:59.762
"Don't worry," said Roxy.

64
00:03:59.763 --> 00:04:06.646
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
